    },
    {
      "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189046",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "KING HENRY.\nSo flies the reckless shepherd from the wolf;\nSo first the harmless sheep doth yield his fleece,\nAnd next his throat unto the butcher’s knife.\nWhat scene of death hath Roscius now to act?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189046/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 11,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189046/line-2",
          "start": 12,
          "end": 57,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189046/line-3",
          "start": 58,
          "end": 108,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189046/line-4",
          "start": 109,
          "end": 154,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189046/line-5",
          "start": 155,
          "end": 199,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2653437,
        "end": 2653681,
        "line": 96621,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap14/p@189046",
        "anchor": "sceneV_14.6"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "KING HENRY.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 11
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189294",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "RICHARD.\nSuspicion always haunts the guilty mind;\nThe thief doth fear each bush an officer.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189294/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189294/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 49,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189294/line-3",
          "start": 50,
          "end": 91,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2653685,
        "end": 2653811,
        "line": 96629,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap14/p@189294",
        "anchor": "sceneV_14.6"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "RICHARD.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189424",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "KING HENRY.\nThe bird that hath been limed in a bush\nWith trembling wings misdoubteth every bush;\nAnd I, the hapless male to one sweet bird,\nHave now the fatal object in my eye\nWhere my poor young was limed, was caught, and killed.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189424/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 11,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189424/line-2",
          "start": 12,
          "end": 51,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189424/line-3",
          "start": 52,
          "end": 96,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189424/line-4",
          "start": 97,
          "end": 139,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189424/line-5",
          "start": 140,
          "end": 175,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189424/line-6",
          "start": 176,
          "end": 230,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2653815,
        "end": 2654095,
        "line": 96635,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap14/p@189424",
        "anchor": "sceneV_14.6"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "KING HENRY.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 11
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189708",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "RICHARD.\nWhy, what a peevish fool was that of Crete\nThat taught his son the office of a fowl!\nAnd yet, for all his wings, the fool was drowned.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189708/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189708/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 51,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189708/line-3",
          "start": 52,
          "end": 93,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189708/line-4",
          "start": 94,
          "end": 143,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2654099,
        "end": 2654282,
        "line": 96644,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap14/p@189708",
        "anchor": "sceneV_14.6"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "RICHARD.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189895",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "KING HENRY.\nI, Daedalus; my poor boy, Icarus;\nThy father, Minos, that denied our course;\nThe sun that seared the wings of my sweet boy,\nThy brother Edward; and thyself, the sea\nWhose envious gulf did swallow up his life.\nAh, kill me with thy weapon, not with words!\nMy breast can better brook thy dagger’s point\nThan can my ears that tragic history.\nBut wherefore dost thou come? Is ’t for my life?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189895/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 11,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189895/line-2",
          "start": 12,
          "end": 45,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189895/line-3",
          "start": 46,
          "end": 88,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189895/line-4",
          "start": 89,
          "end": 135,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189895/line-5",
          "start": 136,
          "end": 176,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189895/line-6",
          "start": 177,
          "end": 220,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189895/line-7",
          "start": 221,
          "end": 265,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189895/line-8",
          "start": 266,
          "end": 311,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189895/line-9",
          "start": 312,
          "end": 349,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.6/p@189895/line-10",
          "start": 350,
          "end": 398,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2654286,
        "end": 2654754,
        "line": 96651,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap14/p@189895",
